SOAPBOX: Probably the last year in this solar cycle that 10m is still
SOAPBOX: shining a bit (be it not as much as last year). Saturday was way better
SOAPBOX: than Sunday, especially in the morning. Only very few NA signals
SOAPBOX: heard and the Caribbean was loud only in the late afternoon.
SOAPBOX: Plenty of SA and I had a short opening to North EU from here.
SOAPBOX: 100W and a 2 ele yagi at 7.5m do not cut it in phone, so almost
SOAPBOX: everything in S&P mode. Had fun though and let's hope the CW leg
SOAPBOX: is as good or better ... 73, Enno, PF5X - CT7BTL
CREATED-BY: N1MM Logger+ 1.0.11466.0
